  "narrative": "The mod_jk connector repeatedly failed to initialize child worker environments between 04:47:44 and 06:13:01 on Dec 04 2005. After successful initialization of workers2.properties configuration, mod_jk child processes consistently entered error state 6 (42 occurrences) and error state 7 (18 occurrences) within seconds. The pattern repeats cyclically: jk2_init finds children in scoreboard slots, workerEnv.init reports success, then immediately mod_jk children enter error states. This suggests a persistent failure in the mod_jk to Tomcat connector communication or backend availability. One unrelated directory index access denial from client 222.166.160.184 occurred at 05:15:09."
 },
